            "nodePID": "21.T15999/CESSDA",
            "description": "<p>The CESSDA Data Catalogue contains the metadata of all data in the holdings of CESSDA service providers. It is a one-stop-shop for search and discovery, enabling effective access to European research data for researchers. Details of over 40, 000 data collections are listed. These are harvested from fifteen different CESSDA Service Providers.</p>",
