            "alternativePIDs": null,
            "nodePID": "21.T15999/CESSDA",
            "description": "<p>The Data Archiving Guide (DAG) is designed to support the work of employees of data repositories by providing a general understanding of the full range of activities a data repository performs. Although the DAG was developed for and by employees of social science data archives, a lot of information applies to other archives as well and is equally useful for archiving professionals from other disciplines.</p>",
