        {
            "id": "service/pCVouY00",
            "name": "CESSDA Data Management Expert Guide",
            "urls": [
                "https://dmeg.cessda.eu/"
            ],
            "alternativePIDs": null,
            "nodePID": "21.T15999/CESSDA",
            "description": "<p>The DMEG is designed by European experts to help social science researchers make their research data Findable, Accessible, Interoperable and Reusable (FAIR). You will be guided by different European experts who are - on a daily basis - busy ensuring long-term access to valuable social science datasets, available for discovery and reuse at one of the CESSDA social science data archives. You can download the full DMEG for your personal study offline (DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.3820473). PDFs for every single chapter are also available for being printed as handouts for training.</p>",
