        {
            "id": "service/YgC1HE00",
            "name": "CESSDA Metadata Validator",
            "urls": [
                "https://www.cessda.eu/Tools/Metadata-Validator"
            ],
            "alternativePIDs": null,
            "nodePID": "21.T15999/CESSDA",
            "description": "<p>The CESSDA Metadata Validator (CMV) validates DDI metadata records used by CESSDA's tools and services, against a given <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/learn/resources/ddi-profiles\">DDI Profile</a>. These DDI Profiles are developed and maintained by the <a href=\"https://www.cessda.eu/Metadata-Office\">Metadata Office</a>. They contain the rules and constraints that metadata records need to follow to be compatible with the <a href=\"https://www.cessda.eu/Tools/Data-Catalogue\">CESSDA Data Catalogue</a> and the European Question Bank.&nbsp;</p>",
